{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297913","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297913","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029791301:1":{"text":"사람 정말 많다... 프라벨, 길 잃지 말고 잘 따라와!","source_cn":"这里的人可真多啊……芙拉贝尔，跟好我，别走丢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2AD1C842BDB9E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029791302:1":{"text":"걱정 마. 난 어린아이가 아니니까.","source_cn":"放心吧，我又不是班上的那些小孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD59829931E85525","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029791303:1":{"text":"라이카, 힘으로만 본다면 네가 나를 이긴다는 보장이 없지 않니?","source_cn":"光是比力气，莱卡可不一定能赢得过我哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF98602510209C26F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029791304:1":{"text":"그럼 안 할래. 내가 졌어.","source_cn":"那不用比了，我甘拜下风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDE826E994A53870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029791305:1":{"text":"애들 셋을 한 손으로 제압하는 너를 누가 이길 수 있겠어?","source_cn":"谁能和你这种单手就制服三个乱跑的小孩子的家伙比啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC61713CD19BA1D35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029791306:1":{"text":"후후후, 부러워서 그러는 거라고 생각할게.","source_cn":"呵呵呵，我就当你是在羡慕我好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2D11CEAB7C76BAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029791307:1":{"text":"그러고 보니, 모처럼의 휴가인데 조금 더 돌아다녀 보자. 여기서 살 수 있는 선물도 좀 찾아보고.","source_cn":"说起来，难得的假期，我们好好逛逛，多买些特产带回去当礼物吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D4EBB1F1080065","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029791308:1":{"text":"응, 이미 리스트 다 정리해 뒀지!","source_cn":"嗯，我已经列好清单了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C8229D88410BEC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:芙拉贝尔":{"text":"프라벨","source":"芙拉贝尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}